  "Attributes": [
    {
      "Id": 938712,
      "attributeType": "LongString",
      "attributeName": "AIDescription",
      "attributeRelationType": "None",
      "Value": "## 1001 Cruncher: A Bone-Chillingly Hilarious Adventure!\n\nStep into the quirky world of *1001 Cruncher* for the Commodore 64, where you control Bono, a delightfully eccentric dragon with a peculiar business model: he's a soap maker! But Bono isn't your average entrepreneur; his secret ingredient? Skeletons! \n\nNavigate 22 increasingly challenging, scrolling levels within a sprawling castle, collecting bones to replenish your soap-making supplies. The gameplay is a fast-paced, action-packed platformer, demanding quick reflexes and strategic planning.  Avoid patrolling guards, dodge treacherous traps, and battle bizarre creatures guarding valuable skeletal remains. \n\n*1001 Cruncher* boasts vibrant, pixelated graphics and a catchy, memorable soundtrack that perfectly complements the game's humorous tone.  It's a unique blend of platforming, puzzle-solving, and dark comedy, offering a refreshingly original experience for Commodore 64 enthusiasts. Can you help Bono keep his soap business booming, one crunchy bone at a time?"
    },
